 Returns `boolean` - Whether the reload was initiated successfully. Only results in `false` when the frame has no history.
 
+#### `frame.hasTransientUserActivation()`
+
+Returns `boolean` - Whether the frame has [transient user activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#transient-activation):
+the user clicked, tapped or pressed a key in it, or in a frame inside it, within the last few seconds. This is
+Chromium's own activation state, which a page's script can't fake.
+
 #### `frame.isDestroyed()`
 
 Returns `boolean` - Whether the frame is destroyed.
